+    // diffuse sample's age the hit pixel's y in bits 0 to 9, the crossing (TracedRay.probeCrossing) in bits 10 and 11,
+    // in bit 12 whether the walk again gives the record's light within 2 %, in bit 13 whether the miss light's part
